[statement]
A package whose condition the preliminary choices do not complete gives
what it depends on no place in the decision order, though its condition
could hold. `e`'s condition names `base`, the one candidate for `B`, and
`zz`, which nothing requires. The walk reaches `e` through `base` before
`W`, and `e` needs `V`; yet `W` is decided first, for `kw`, which answers
`V` too, and `gk` is not installed. Contrast
`a-condition-naming-a-candidate-has-its-turn-there`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:B W K

P:base
V:1
p:B=1

P:e
V:1
D:V
i:base zz

P:zz
V:1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:V

P:kw
V:1
p:V W=1

P:pk
V:1
D:V
p:K=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install kw 1
install pk 1
install top 1
